<title>TURKEY: Turkey's Toprakbank signs $30 mln syndicated loan.</title>
<headline>Turkey's Toprakbank signs $30 mln syndicated loan.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's private Toprakbank signed an accord on Monday for a $30 million syndicated loan, led by The Bank of New York, Toprakbank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The bank did not disclose terms of the one-year pre-export financing facility, provided by 14 banks.</p>
<p>The accord was signed in Istanbul.</p>
</text>
